        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Perfect for outdoor installation, especially in Denison yards with suitable space or slope-front access. These shelters are discreet and provide ultimate protection below ground, often fitting well into existing landscapes near Lake Texoma.</p>
      </div>
