    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 18px;">Why Choose Texoma Storm Shelters for Your Denison Property?</h2>
    <div class="rich"><p>When you choose Texoma Storm Shelters, you are partnering with a local, licensed, and insured life-safety expert dedicated to protecting the Denison community. Our commitment goes beyond installation; we provide transparent communication and reliable service from start to finish. We understand the specific weather patterns and soil conditions common in the Texoma area, ensuring your shelter is installed correctly and securely.</p><p>We offer a range of options to fit various property types, from older homes in Denison's historic district to newer developments. Our team provides free written estimates, so you know the full cost upfront, with no hidden fees. We are available for emergency storm shelter installations during severe weather events, prioritizing your safety above all else.</p></div>
