        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">We understand the urgency when severe weather is imminent. Texoma Storm Shelters offers an emergency line for severe weather and storm shelter installation requests. While lead times vary, we prioritize rapid deployment in Denison during high-risk periods to ensure your family's safety as quickly as possible. Contact us immediately if you have urgent needs.</p>
